      "text": "Compress cobblestone through eight tiers to save storage space. Triple and Quadruple Compressed Cobblestone are also used to make $(l:extrautilitiesrebirth:materials/bedrockium)Bedrockium$(/l). A single octuple block packs more than 43 million cobblestone."
